# Build context hygiene. The Dockerfile COPYs the repo, so anything large or
# machine-specific that is not an input to `cargo oxide build` is excluded.
#
# Do NOT exclude: Cargo.lock, .cargo/, rust-toolchain.toml, src/, assets/tests/.
# Cargo.lock pins the cuda-oxide SHA the image must build against, and
# .cargo/cuda-oxide.toml carries default-arch.
target/
.oxide-artifacts/
*.ptx
*.ll
bench/
results/
benchmarks/runpod/
.git/
.github/
.claude/
PLAN.md
assets/runpod/
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
